# oracle: pair_style pace (recursive) with a B-basis .yaml potential, converted to the C-tilde basis: the self-made two-element basis of pace_extrapolation_full on a random fcc Cu-Ni cell, 500 K NVE
# Native reference: LAMMPS b332f28 built with PKG_ML-PACE (the installed binary has no ML-PACE)
# Measured with native LAMMPS: max relative error engine vs native thermo 1.3e-14, atoms 4.4e-16.
# oracle-inputs: pace_al_cuni.yaml
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           metal
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 3.55
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 box
set             type 1 type/fraction 2 0.4 8812
mass            1 63.546
mass            2 58.693
displace_atoms  all random 0.08 0.08 0.08 7731 units box
pair_style      pace
pair_coeff      * * pace_al_cuni.yaml Cu Ni
velocity        all create 500 991 loop geom
fix             1 all nve
thermo_style    custom step pe ke etotal press pxx pyz
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          5
run             20
